config ITERATE_KIT_DIAGNOSTIC_SILENT_OUTPUT
    bool "Suppress physical speaker output for board diagnostics"
    default n
    help
        A diagnostic-only build switch. It keeps a table board's amplifier
        disabled and replaces every local or streamed PCM write with silence
        at the shared hardware boundary. I2S TX remains clocked so boards
        whose microphone DSP needs a continuous playback reference still run
        normally. Health exposes attempted and zero-written sample counters.

        This is deliberately compile-time only. Production firmware must not
        silently lose playout through a runtime mode or provider setting.
